sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor UI
participant RT as ReplayRuntime
participant Pool as ThreadPoolExecutor
participant R as replay()
participant S as AccountStore
participant I as read_source() / InfluxDB
participant D as unary() / correlation()
UI->>RT: start(store)
RT->>S: snapshot() -> revision
RT->>Pool: submit(run)
Pool->>R: replay(store, progress)
R->>S: snapshot() -> workspace, revision
loop each used datasource once
    R->>I: read_source(source)
    I-->>R: raw numeric series, skipped count
end
loop each metric and binding
    R->>D: fresh instance per series / pair
    D-->>R: scores, ready_points, status
    Note over R,D: ValueError / TypeError / ArithmeticError become detector status=error
end
R->>S: snapshot() -> current revision
alt revision changed
    R-->>Pool: ValueError, no publication
    Note over RT,Pool: Worker retries from raw data if its revision changed
else revision unchanged
    R->>S: save_results(result, revision)
    Note over S: Row lock, persist only if enabled and revision matches
    R-->>Pool: result (also kept in process RAM)
end
UI->>RT: result(store)
RT-->>UI: matching revision or persisted matching result
